poorseek forks infr / MoE4All (https://github.com/Headmaster218/MoE4All) and
thanks the following upstream work:
  - MoE4All (infr): pager / slot / LUT / host-tier substrate, DSV4.1 loader.
  - Strata: hot/cold expert paging (expert_cache, expert_source, host-tier
    complement) and adaptive tier design.
  - llama.cpp: GGUF format, quant kernels, MoE routing (n_expert_used), and
    the deepseek41.cpp reference implementation.
  - DeepSeek: DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash model and CED architecture.
